(7506802, 1197217, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>Welcome to DPC Srikanth, I can understand why you have chosen this subject for this challenge. It is very colourful and interesting and lends itself easily to over-saturation so a very appropriate choice. What lets it down is the exposure, you have significant areas over over-exposure with completely blow highlights that are to the detriment of the end result. I think the composition could also be improved this feels too cluttered and rushed, perhaps a lower viewpoint with more emphasis on the foreground. Good luck with your future entries</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that meets the challenge Welcome to DPC Srikanth, I can understand why you have chosen this subject for this challenge. It is very colourful and interesting and lends itself easily to over-saturation so a very appropriate choice. What lets it down is the exposure, you have significant areas over over-exposure with completely blow highlights that are to the detriment of the end result. I think the composition could also be improved this feels too cluttered and rushed, perhaps a lower viewpoint with more emphasis on the foreground. Good luck with your future entries', '2017-03-29 16:39:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7506803, 1197097, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>Congratulations Luana, a great result for a great image. I love what you have done here it works so well. It just goes to prove how powerful the simple concept can be. The plain colours and your placement is perfect. I think a judicious crop of the right edge would improve it, leaving it to just the two colours and removing the odd half a bricked windows and gutter pipe, this would make it an even stronger image. Well done Luana</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well Congratulations Luana, a great result for a great image. I love what you have done here it works so well. It just goes to prove how powerful the simple concept can be. The plain colours and your placement is perfect. I think a judicious crop of the right edge would improve it, leaving it to just the two colours and removing the odd half a bricked windows and gutter pipe, this would make it an even stronger image. Well done Luana', '2017-03-29 16:49:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7506804, 1196593, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>Welcome to DPC Yao. I like your thinking behind the image but I dont think it quite works as well as you would have hoped. The main thing that lets it down for this specific challenge is that there is far more soft focus than sharp focus. This would not have mattered if you had really concentrated on the sharper aspects by over saturating and over sharpening them they would have really stood out strongly against the rest of the image. Alternatively perhaps a closer crop of the sharp flower may have worked better?</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge Welcome to DPC Yao. I like your thinking behind the image but I dont think it quite works as well as you would have hoped. The main thing that lets it down for this specific challenge is that there is far more soft focus than sharp focus. This would not have mattered if you had really concentrated on the sharper aspects by over saturating and over sharpening them they would have really stood out strongly against the rest of the image. Alternatively perhaps a closer crop of the sharp flower may have worked better?', '2017-03-29 16:56:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7506806, 1196798, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>A very appropriate choice for the challenge it is certainly very colourful. Your composition is good too, the red dinosaur is particularly dominant but not too overpowering leaving room for the blue dinosaur too. What I think lets it down is your selections for the saturation, it is obvious in the paler portions of the sky in the more intricate areas that were not included in your original selection. Overall a good and appropriate image for the challenge, well done.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge A very appropriate choice for the challenge it is certainly very colourful. Your composition is good too, the red dinosaur is particularly dominant but not too overpowering leaving room for the blue dinosaur too. What I think lets it down is your selections for the saturation, it is obvious in the paler portions of the sky in the more intricate areas that were not included in your original selection. Overall a good and appropriate image for the challenge, well done.', '2017-03-29 17:03:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7506807, 1197198, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>I get to comment on it twice!! Everything from previous still applies and whilst I wouldnt recommend this sort of post processing it is necessary for the challenge and to an extent it does actually enhance it. The sharpening is particularly effective on the seas. What does let it down is the halo around the lighthouse it is rather too obvious and intrusive. Well done for the high score and placement.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge I get to comment on it twice!! Everything from previous still applies and whilst I wouldnt recommend this sort of post processing it is necessary for the challenge and to an extent it does actually enhance it. The sharpening is particularly effective on the seas. What does let it down is the halo around the lighthouse it is rather too obvious and intrusive. Well done for the high score and placement.', '2017-03-29 17:12:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7506808, 1197229, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>I would agree with your commenter you certainly have these alligators well sussed. Obviously everything is over-saturated but is that purple really the natural hue this may help explain why it didnt score higher it leaves it looking somewhat unnatural. Your composition is good with the gator emerging from the right with looking space to the left it works well.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge I would agree with your commenter you certainly have these alligators well sussed. Obviously everything is over-saturated but is that purple really the natural hue this may help explain why it didnt score higher it leaves it looking somewhat unnatural. Your composition is good with the gator emerging from the right with looking space to the left it works well.', '2017-03-29 17:19:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7506812, 1197009, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>I like your low viewpoint and use of motion blur from the long exposure. The placement of your main person is good with lots of added interest from all the other people too. I agree and disagree with one of your commenters, I agree that a little less exposure would help the saturation of the colours but I disagree about the composition. I like the lack of symmetry but more important if you had done as suggested you would have lost that love golden arch and inner wall, that is such a powerful element in the image it needs to stay. You could perhaps have altered the composition by moving it further to the right. All in all good creative vision well done Jonathon.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge I like your low viewpoint and use of motion blur from the long exposure. The placement of your main person is good with lots of added interest from all the other people too. I agree and disagree with one of your commenters, I agree that a little less exposure would help the saturation of the colours but I disagree about the composition. I like the lack of symmetry but more important if you had done as suggested you would have lost that love golden arch and inner wall, that is such a powerful element in the image it needs to stay. You could perhaps have altered the composition by moving it further to the right. All in all good creative vision well done Jonathon.', '2017-03-29 17:26:38.000000', NULL, 0),
